<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-032" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu" source-id="s-nanqishu-032-zhangshu-ws1513918">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">兄子<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0002" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAEA">瓌</persName>、弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0005" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG">恕</persName>，誅吳郡太守<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0012" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBA">劉遐</persName>。太祖欲以<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0019" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG">恕</persName>爲晉陵郡，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0025" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD">岱</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0029" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG">恕</persName>未閑從政，美錦不宜濫裁。」太祖曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0048" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG">恕</persName>爲人，我所悉。且又與<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0059" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAEA">瓌</persName>同勳，自應有賞。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0069" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD">岱</persName>曰：「若以家貧賜祿，此所不論；語功推事，臣門之恥。」</p>
</text>
